Six presets take their colours from these themes. Each palette was copied
from the theme's published colours and then, where a colour is used as text,
moved toward black or white just far enough to reach a 4.5:1 contrast ratio,
so some values differ from the originals. The theme names belong to their
authors; cozy-skin is not affiliated with them.

  solarized    Solarized, Copyright (c) 2011 Ethan Schoonover. MIT License.
  gruvbox      Gruvbox, Copyright (c) 2012 Pavel Pertsev. MIT License.
  nord         Nord, Copyright (c) 2016 Arctic Ice Studio and Sven Greb. MIT License.
  dracula      Dracula and Alucard, Copyright (c) 2016 Dracula Theme. MIT License.
  catppuccin   Catppuccin (Latte, Mocha), Copyright (c) 2021 Catppuccin. MIT License.
  tokyo-night  Tokyo Night (Day, Night), Copyright (c) 2018 enkia. MIT License.

